    "title": "Reset in the park-take a walk outside Aug. 12 with nature interpreter Gale Rublee - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Muddy River News ,\n14 hours ago HANNIBAL — Hannibal Parks & Recreation is starting a series of walks at different parks on the second Wednesday of the month. The first one walk will be 5:30-6:30 p.m. Wednesday, Aug. 12, at Central Park. “Wednesday Wonder Walk and Tree Scavenger Hunt” will be led by HPR nature interpreter Gale Rublee and members of the Mississippi Hills Master Naturalists. Read full article",
